1
00:01:16,941 --> 00:01:20,843
With this project, to get people's formation around forest -

2
00:01:20,843 --> 00:01:27,070
- And be out with other people in the forest who are committed and want to learn more.

3
00:01:27,070 --> 00:01:30,519
It gives an incredible amount of energy and joy.

4
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:36,271
So for me it has become a way to make my commitment more sustainable.

5
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:48,758
I have several examples here in Västerbotten where it is thanks to the commitment of individuals -

6
00:01:48,758 --> 00:01:57,231
- That many forest areas remain.
That they were excluded from harvesting and maybe even today is a reserve.

7
00:02:00,318 --> 00:02:04,448
My dream is well ..

8
00:02:04,448 --> 00:02:06,459
... another forestry.

9
00:02:06,459 --> 00:02:18,358
Where we do not have this calving use, but where all forests with high natural values receive long -term protection.

10
00:02:18,358 --> 00:02:22,440
And that we use the forest in a different way than we do today.

11
00:02:23,211 --> 00:02:24,836
It is a possible dream.
